'' A doubling macro thirty levels deep nests only thirty frames and expands to 2^30 tokens:
'' it ran past 1 GB in 20 s. The preprocessor stops at its token-volume cap with TKO0372.
'' The cap is PP_MAX_TOKENS (16M, about 37 s to reach under Debug); TKO_PP_MAX_TOKENS lowers
'' it so the same code path runs in a fraction of a second.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --check tests/diagnostics/src/macro-volume-cap.bas
'' ENV: TKO_PP_MAX_TOKENS=100000
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: error TKO0372: the preprocessed program exceeded 100000 tokens; a macro is expanding without bound
